message: "If you use this software or its manifests, please cite the manuscript and this release."
title: "Similarity-Aware Evaluation of a Shared-Weight Dual-View DeiT3 Model with Crop-Policy Ablation for Lung CT Classification"
abstract: >-
  Research code and locked evaluation artifacts for a shared-weight dual-view
  DeiT3-Base image classifier on a curated four-class lung CT image collection
  (adenocarcinoma, large-cell carcinoma, normal, squamous cell carcinoma).
  This release covers the dual-view system (arm A2), its 558-image development
  out-of-fold predictions, its locked 288-image same-source test predictions,
  the dataset-relative inventory with 508 dHash similarity groups and five
  group-disjoint folds, and aggregate external DICOM reports. It does not cover
  the independent-baseline arms (A1, A3, A4) or the crop-policy arms (S1, S2, S3),
  whose training artifacts were not available at staging time.
